1
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,680
Thank you for saving me, My Lord.

2
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:14,760
When do you plan

3
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:17,380
to take me to see your cousin, my lady?

4
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,570
The day after tomorrow.

5
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:21,960
The day after tomorrow

6
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:24,360
is the death anniversary of her close relative.

7
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:25,520
She goes to pay her respects every year

8
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,440
without fail.

9
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,200
We can wait there

10
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:30,400
at 5:00 a.m. the day after tomorrow.

11
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,040
By then,

12
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:32,759
we will surely catch her.

13
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,320
I will not allow

14
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:42,080
any more mistakes this time.

15
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:44,210
Understood.

16
00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:50,840
Young Master.

17
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:57,340
Do you really think Lady Fang is the Young Madam?

18
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:00,160
This is too bizarre.

19
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,760
We've been looking for Fang Qingcheng,

20
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:05,319
but have we ever really seen her?

21
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:09,440
Do you remember

22
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:11,360
what Fang Zhuozhuo said in the water dungeon?

23
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:13,690
Share the prosperity of Yanzhi Pavilion.

24
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,480
I just thought

25
00:01:19,039 --> 00:01:21,800
she was talking big because she had Madam Li backing her up.

26
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:22,400
But what if

27
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:26,000
Yanzhi Pavilion belongs to her in the first place?

28
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:26,660
But they are

29
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:28,289
one fat and one thin.

30
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:30,560
Even if she is good at makeup,

31
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:32,810
it's hard to change her body shape.

32
00:01:33,759 --> 00:01:35,759
Once you eliminate the impossible,

33
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:39,170
whatever remains, no matter how improbable,

34
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,200
must be the truth.

35
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,440
Miss.

36
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:45,840
This is the rouge that Weirui mixed with Angelica

37
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:47,240
before giving it to them.

38
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,720
Have you found Weirui?

39
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:50,600
I found her.

40
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,680
Just as you expected, My Lady.

41
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:54,800
She tried to sneak out of the city under the cover of night.

42
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,280
As you ordered,

43
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,520
we have detained her.

44
00:01:57,759 --> 00:02:00,040
What do you plan to do with her?

45
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,040
She is not bad by nature.

46
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:04,330
She was just forced by circumstances.

47
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,680
It's hard on her.

48
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,520
Her mother

49
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,960
took advantage of your absence

50
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:11,560
and came to the pavilion to make trouble time and time again.

51
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,120
She also has a good-for-nothing brother.

52
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,760
He needs money to get married,

53
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,200
to repair the house,

54
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:19,050
and Weirui even has to pay off his gambling debts.

55
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,240
But no matter how hard it is,

56
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,920
she shouldn't have harmed Yanzhi Pavilion.

57
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:23,880
Go and tell her

58
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:26,200
that all I want is her written testimony

59
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,760
to prove Yanzhi Pavilion's innocence.

60
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:28,760
If she can do that,

61
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,660
I will let bygones be bygones.

62
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,329
As for what comes after,

63
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:34,200
I will arrange everything for her.

64
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:34,960
Yes, My Lady.

65
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,170
I will go right away.

66
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:42,460
You are in a good mood, my husband.

67
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,280
Aren't you going to come out with me

68
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,940
and catch my cousin together?

69
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:48,480
Even if I go,

70
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:52,530
I'm afraid I won't be able to see her today, right?

71
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:54,800
My husband.

72
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:57,600
The person who arranged to poison Yanzhi Pavilion

73
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:58,560
is now

74
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,440
in my hands.

75
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:05,280
That's wonderful.

76
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Since the real culprit has been caught,

77
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,200
then Yanzhi Pavilion

78
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,160
can be cleared of suspicion.

79
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:14,040
Why are you

80
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:15,680
so agreeable today?

81
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:26,160
Oh no, Chu Shengyi must have a backup plan.

82
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:27,160
Yanzhi Pavilion!

83
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:29,120
Wait.

84
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,600
Why are you in such a hurry?

85
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:34,760
Are you going to get help, my wife?

86
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,250
Don't rush, my wife.

87
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:46,520
I

88
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,520
will go with you.

89
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,520
Why?

90
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,640
What are you doing?

91
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:54,840
Why are you kicking us out?

92
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,400
Why won't you let us open our shop?

93
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,400
Alright, get out.

94
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,320
What should we do?

95
00:03:58,320 --> 00:03:59,000
The pavilion master isn't here.

96
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,660
I don't know what to do either.

97
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:02,400
What should we do?

98
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:03,520
You!

99
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:04,240
Hold on.

100
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:07,080
The poisoning incident has been investigated.

101
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,960
This matter has nothing to do with Yanzhi Pavilion.

102
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,560
It was done by a makeup artist

103
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:11,800
for her own selfish interests,

104
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:14,800
with the intention of harming Pavilion Master Qingcheng.

105
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,060
Here is the testimony.

106
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:19,839
Furthermore,

107
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:23,240
this is Angelica dahurica.

108
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:25,880
It is the poison that was mixed into the Yuzhi sandalwood.

109
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:27,160
Angelica dahurica is not poisonous.

110
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:29,440
It only causes temporary redness and swelling of the skin.

111
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,520
You can compare it with the poisoned rouge, Sir,

112
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:33,050
and you will know the truth.

113
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:40,540
Third Young Master can also testify.

114
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:54,720
What my wife says

115
00:04:58,840 --> 00:04:59,970
is indeed the truth.

116
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,850
Third Young Master.

117
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,000
Master San.

118
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,330
We are not here today

119
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,610
for the poisoning at Yanzhi Pavilion.

120
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:11,400
But during our recent tax audit, we found

121
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:15,080
that Yanzhi Pavilion's taxes over the past six months are short,

122
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:16,810
and the amount is significant.

123
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:18,160
According to the law,

124
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,840
it must be sealed.

125
00:05:19,840 --> 00:05:20,600
Impossible.

126
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,040
There is absolutely no problem with Yanzhi Pavilion's taxes.

127
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,360
You can check again.

128
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,640
If you want to check again,

129
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:29,280
we must wait for Pavilion Master Fang to come in person.

130
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:29,760
Seal it.

131
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:34,640
Wait a minute.

132
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:39,040
Every expense of Yanzhi Pavilion is recorded in the ledger.

133
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,370
I can check it right now.

134
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:45,400
What? You know how to keep accounts?

135
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:48,640
Though I'm not the Pavilion Master,

136
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:50,240
I know a little about accounting.

137
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:52,000
If the accounts are incorrect,

138
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,960
you'll be interfering with official duties, Miss.

139
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:57,400
If there's even a single coin of discrepancy in the accounts,

140
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:59,320
I will willingly accept the punishment.

141
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:00,680
That's not a bad idea.

142
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,370
Since there are doubts,

143
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,680
why not make it clear

144
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:06,480
to show the fairness of the Municipal Office's law enforcement.

145
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:06,940
This...

146
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,810
I will follow your orders, Master San.

147
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,760
Fang Zhuozhuo, since when did you know these things?

148
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:21,720
Come back here.

149
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:22,560
Exactly.

150
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,450
Don't ruin Yanzhi Pavilion

151
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:25,640
and everyone else.

152
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:54,720
Sir, the accounts are here.

153
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:55,960
Over the past six months,

154
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:57,280
Yanzhi Pavilion has paid a total of

155
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:58,960
172 taels and 6 mace of silver.

156
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:00,360
Not a penny less.

157
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,160
In the ledger the Municipal Office got,

158
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:11,420
someone added a stroke on the third page,

159
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:13,720
changing the 220 boxes of Peach Blossom Rouge

160
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:15,280
to 450 boxes.

161
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:18,600
On the fourth page, someone used copperas water

162
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,840
to erase an expense of 20 taels for incense and medicine.

163
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:22,600
Every expense of Yanzhi Pavilion

164
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,120
has a receipt to verify.

165
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:26,800
If the officials don't believe it, they can check again.

166
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:30,040
The person who cooked the books is clumsy.

167
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:32,940
Since that's the case,

168
00:07:33,159 --> 00:07:36,320
the discrepancies in the accounts still need to be reviewed.

169
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:37,920
You can take the ledgers and receipts

170
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:40,400
back to the Municipal Office to check carefully, sir.

171
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:42,640
If there are still problems with the taxes by then,

172
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:44,640
it won't be too late to seal the shop.

173
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:53,900
Take them all away.

174
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,330
Your calculation, my lady,

175
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:31,850
is even sharper than an old registrar.

176
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,240
If one didn't know the situation,

177
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,080
they would probably think

178
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:36,480
that you are the Master of Yanzhi Pavilion.

179
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:40,600
My cousin occasionally teaches me when keeping accounts.

180
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,260
What's so strange about that?

181
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:46,700
These few accounts

182
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:50,200
are all transactions after Fang Qingcheng went missing.

183
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:50,960
These past few days,

184
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,360
I've been following you.

185
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,920
How did she tell you out of thin air

186
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:56,000
that 450 boxes

187
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,980
of Peach Blossom Rouge were sold?

188
00:08:58,960 --> 00:08:59,800
Chu Shengyi,

189
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:02,060
why must you be so aggressive?

190
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:08,100
How long are you going to keep acting?

191
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:08,640
You...

192
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:13,240
I'll let you open.

193
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:28,200
Did I guess wrong?

194
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,440
Fang Qingcheng.

195
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:38,680
I finally found you.

196
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:10,040
I only found out by chance.

197
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:12,000
This rouge

198
00:10:12,760 --> 00:10:14,620
has the power of transformation.

199
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,160
I took over Yanzhi Pavilion

200
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:19,360
from my grandmother.

201
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:21,490
If I showed myself as Zhuozhuo,

202
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:23,960
I couldn't maintain the pavilion at all.

203
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:24,720
So,

204
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:27,160
I used this rouge

205
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,520
under the identity of Qingcheng

206
00:10:29,800 --> 00:10:31,360
to manage the pavilion's affairs.

207
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:33,490
You revealed yourself directly to me,

208
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:37,080
aren't you afraid I'll really kill you?

209
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,680
Earlier in the black market,

210
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:46,210
I found out the rouge box you bought was a fake.

211
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:48,120
Later, I went to the boss

212
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,850
and got this authentic one.

213
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:51,960
Copper rusts easily,

214
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:54,860
but it would never corrode like this.

215
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,760
The rouge box your mother used

216
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:58,370
was mixed with calomel.

217
00:10:58,680 --> 00:11:00,320
Calomel is colorless and odorless,

218
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:02,780
but if mixed in rouge and used for a long time,

219
00:11:02,920 --> 00:11:04,080
it will be fatal.

220
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:05,840
Your mother's death,

221
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:07,280
I'm afraid,

222
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:10,330
was not caused by a severe illness.

223
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:12,800
As for the truth,

224
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,600
you will know once you check.

225
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:16,360
I have no reason to lie to you.

226
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:18,240
As for who poisoned her,

227
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:19,800
I think

228
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:23,000
you should have a guess in your mind.

229
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:35,120
Why tell me now?

230
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:36,640
I just want to tell you

231
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,000
that my goal

232
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:40,570
is only to win the Makeup Competition.

233
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,440
The Quantan delegation

234
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,000
will eventually reach Kuizhou.

235
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,320
If I guess correctly,

236
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:53,000
Ye Xin should also arrive with them.

237
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:57,520
I have a way

238
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:58,960
to spare Qingcheng

239
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,560
and still get Ye Xin back.

240
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:05,280
Want to make a deal?

241
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:11,160
Since the Battle of Kuishui, Kuizhou and Quantan

242
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:13,240
have been at peace for many years.

243
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:16,520
The young Prince of Quantan brought a caravan to Kuizhou this time

244
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:18,080
for the salt merchants.

245
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:19,720
And Kuizhou's salt trade

246
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:21,680
is all in Madam Li's hands.

247
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,040
The Governor is seriously ill

248
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:25,800
and ordered Madam Li to host the Prince well

249
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:28,840
to strengthen the friendship between our two states.

250
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:29,560
Madam.

251
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:34,240
It's been years since we parted.

252
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:36,520
You are even more graceful than before.

253
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:38,880
Is everything well with you?

254
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:41,280
Thank you for your concern, Prince.

255
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:42,440
Everything is fine.

256
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:44,400
For your visit to Kuizhou this time, Prince,

257
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:46,120
how many days do you plan to stay?

258
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,760
My father

259
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:48,920
worries day and night about the salt trade.

260
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:52,440
He ordered me to stay longer and discuss it in detail with you,

261
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:54,600
and to learn more from you.

262
00:12:57,040 --> 00:12:59,120
I heard you are a light sleeper.

263
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:01,480
These are herbs I collected from the Western Regions.

264
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:03,840
A Quantan shaman used a secret method to extract the oil.

265
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:06,040
Just one drop by your pillow

266
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:08,530
will calm your mind and nourish your skin.

267
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:13,840
The Governor was supposed to come in person today

268
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,440
to fulfill his duties as the host.

269
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:17,040
However, his old illness suddenly relapsed,

270
00:13:17,040 --> 00:13:18,920
making it inconvenient for him to see guests.

271
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:22,050
So he ordered me to host a banquet in the East Flower Hall.

272
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:25,040
The dishes are all local flavors of Kuizhou

273
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:27,450
to relieve your fatigue from the journey.

274
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:28,600
Thank you, Madam.

275
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:31,080
I also wish the Governor a speedy recovery.

276
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,040
Prince.

277
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:34,120
Please.

278
00:13:35,680 --> 00:13:37,440
I wonder if the arrangements at the post house

279
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:38,840
